# <%= projectName %>

A TypeScript HTTP server with API routes, created from Putnami's
`typescript-server` template.

## Commands

```bash
putnami serve <%= projectName %>            # run it locally, reloading on change
putnami lint,test,build <%= projectName %>  # check it the way CI does
```

## Documentation

This README is the project's entry point. Put longer pages under `doc/` and
link them from here: `putnami lint` fails on a relative link or an anchor that
does not resolve. Putnami itself is documented at <https://putnami.dev/docs>.
